":"宋四家","content":"宋四家指苏轼、黄庭坚、米芾和蔡襄。四人是宋代重要书法家，苏轼的行书作品包括《寒食帖》。","label":"宋四家","note":"宋四家指苏轼、黄庭坚、米芾和蔡襄。四人是宋代重要书法家，苏轼的行书作品包括《寒食帖》。","learningGoal":"准确说出宋四家并识别苏轼的《寒食帖》。","productionMode":"reuse","productionLabel":"直接复用","semanticRevision":1,"pointId":"traditional-arts","tabId":"calligraphy","sourceUnitIds":["cs-10-15-p16-p17-calligraphy-table"],"sourceUrl":"/subpackages/common-sense/detail/index?moduleId=common-sense&pointId=traditional-arts&tabId=calligraphy","mapping":"source-overlap","review":{"admission":"expansion-candidate","sourceFidelity":"self-reviewed","noviceReadability":"pending-user-sampling","independentFactReview":"pending-independent-review"},"signature":"a8583b23","learningSignature":"a4c7335b"}]